  "title": "Configuration restore replays unauthenticated requests against protected Configuration Agent",
  "description": "On a server with nonzero device/master ACLs, saving a private configuration succeeds but restoring it fails. The saved file contains new*Vector requests to Configuration Agent without tokens; load_configuration parses it through a CONFIG_READER client and the bus rejects those requests. Next: authorize trusted local configuration replay without allowing network ACL bypass, then rerun private configuration restoration. Owner explicitly requests tests/findings only; no production fix authorized.\n\nImported from .factory/findings/active/FND-20261105112837-9c3a-sequencer-simulator-suite-005.json (category: functional, blocking: no).",
